compile: cmake -G Ninja -S . -B build
cmake --build build to run

To enable / run Tracy Profiler:
cmake -G Ninja -S . -B build -DTRACY_ENABLE=ON -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo

Tracy profiler is included in the CMake. Run these commands to build:
cmake -S build/_deps/tracy-src/profiler -B build/tracy-profiler -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
cmake --build build/tracy-profiler --parallel
./build/tracy-profiler/tracy-profiler
